message: >-
  If you use Hard-Sphere Bridge in research or teaching, please cite this
  software and the specific release used.
title: Hard-Sphere Bridge
type: software
authors:
  - name: F1red0g3
abstract: >-
  A CUDA-accelerated Newtonian hard-sphere simulator with synchronized
  microscopic particle samples, mesoscopic phase-space statistics,
  macroscopic fluid moments, and an independent ideal-gas Euler reference.
repository-code: https://github.com/MozillaFiredoge/hard-sphere-bridge
url: https://github.com/MozillaFiredoge/hard-sphere-bridge
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - hard-sphere dynamics
  - kinetic theory
  - CUDA
  - Boltzmann equation
  - fluid dynamics
